+| 时间 | 🟢 | System |
+| Calendar | 🟢 | EventKit / Google |
+| Reminders | 🟢 | EventKit |
+| GPS / 地理围栏 | 🟢 | Core Location |
+| Weather | 🟢 | Weather/API |
